      "title": "dfilter: Allow parsing binary number as a byte array of len 1",
      "message": "dfilter: Allow parsing binary number as a byte array of len 1\n\nBefore:\n\n    Filter: eth[0] == 0b00110011\n\n    Instructions:\n    00000 READ_TREE\t\teth -> reg#0\n    00001 IF_FALSE_GOTO\t4\n    00002 MK_RANGE\t\treg#0[reg#1] -> 0:1\n    00003 ANY_EQ\t\treg#1 == 0b:00:11:00:11 <FT_BYTES>\n    00004 RETURN\n\nAfter:\n\n    Filter: eth[0] == 0b00110011\n\n    Instructions:\n    00000 READ_TREE\t\teth -> reg#0\n    00001 IF_FALSE_GOTO\t4\n    00002 MK_RANGE\t\treg#0[reg#1] -> 0:1\n    00003 ANY_EQ\t\treg#1 == 33 <FT_BYTES>\n    00004 RETURN\n",
